/Fog_shadow_of_GGB.jpg/500px-Fog_shadow_of_GGB.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/96/Fog_shadow_of_GGB.jpg/1280px-Fog_shadow_of_GGB.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/96/Fog_shadow_of_GGB.jpg/500px-Fog_shadow_of_GGB.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Fog shadow of the south tower of the Golden Gate Bridge","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AFog_shadow_of_GGB.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/21/Moonlight_shadow.jpg/500px-Moonlight_shadow.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/21/Moonlight_shadow.jpg/1280px-Moonlight_shadow.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/21/Moonlight_shadow.jpg/500px-Moonlight_shadow.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Moonlight shadow of a photographer","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AMoonlight_shadow.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/72/Shadow_Wall_-_before.png/120px-Shadow_Wall_-_before.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/72/Shadow_Wall_-_before.png/250px-Shadow_Wall_-_before.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/72/Shadow_Wall_-_before.png/120px-Shadow_Wall_-_before.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AShadow_Wall_-_before.png"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commo